Package: ramb
Type: Package
Title: Vessel Track Tools and the ICES Fishing-Activity Flow
Version: 2026.10.14.8
Authors@R: c(
  person("Einar", "Hjörleifsson", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "einar.hjorleifsson@gmail.com"),
  person("Charles", "Karney", role = "ctb", comment = "GeographicLib-C geodesic.c/h, vendored unchanged in src/ (MIT/X11); see inst/COPYRIGHTS")
  )
Maintainer: Einar Hjörleifsson <einar.hjorleifsson@gmail.com>
Description: Tools for vessel-track (AIS/VMS) data and the steps of the ICES
    fishing-activity flow (WGSFD): flagging pings, finding port stays, cutting
    trips, building record windows, and gear, effort and catch handling.
    Everything returns tibbles for downstream tidyverse processing, and data
    frames and lazy DuckDB tables give the same result.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://heima.hafro.is/~einarhj/ramb,
